        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Draft Online For Free!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DraftPunk is a CCG with a focus on draft play. Set up a draft pod and invite your friends, or play against AI bots.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586890/extras/09a6617627f1cf8c8c00198b19acb1cc.avif?t=1759820672\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586890/extras_big/09a6617627f1cf8c8c00198b19acb1cc.avif?t=1759820672 width=800 height=400 /></span>Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Draft from a big pool of unique cards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complex deck building with deep synergies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set up and configure a draft environment that suits your group.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Free to Play on Steam! Just download and jump in.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586890/extras/72a584e17a3314d2e4aa7a323ab852be.avif?t=1759820672\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586890/extras_big/72a584e17a3314d2e4aa7a323ab852be.avif?t=1759820672 width=800 height=400 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Play Online or Solo</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create a Private draft pod and play against your friends, or go Public and play against other people on Steam.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Draftpunk also has challenging AI opponents that you can draft and play against solo.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586890/extras/c796c8f64c71655e293099253df0aa25.avif?t=1759820672\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586890/extras_big/c796c8f64c71655e293099253df0aa25.avif?t=1759820672 width=800 height=400 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586890/extras/e9b2e67f3390e06d0b502bb36ee2fb68.avif?t=1759820672\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586890/extras_big/e9b2e67f3390e06d0b502bb36ee2fb68.avif?t=1759820672 width=800 height=400 /></span></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Draft Online For Free!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DraftPunk is a CCG with a focus on draft play. Set up a draft pod and invite your friends, or play against AI bots.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586890/extras/09a6617627f1cf8c8c00198b19acb1cc.avif?t=1759820672\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586890/extras_big/09a6617627f1cf8c8c00198b19acb1cc.avif?t=1759820672 width=800 height=400 /></span>Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Draft from a big pool of unique cards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complex deck building with deep synergies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set up and configure a draft environment that suits your group.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Free to Play on Steam! Just download and jump in.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586890/extras/72a584e17a3314d2e4aa7a323ab852be.avif?t=1759820672\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586890/extras_big/72a584e17a3314d2e4aa7a323ab852be.avif?t=1759820672 width=800 height=400 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Play Online or Solo</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create a Private draft pod and play against your friends, or go Public and play against other people on Steam.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Draftpunk also has challenging AI opponents that you can draft and play against solo.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586890/extras/c796c8f64c71655e293099253df0aa25.avif?t=1759820672\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586890/extras_big/c796c8f64c71655e293099253df0aa25.avif?t=1759820672 width=800 height=400 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586890/extras/e9b2e67f3390e06d0b502bb36ee2fb68.avif?t=1759820672\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586890/extras_big/e9b2e67f3390e06d0b502bb36ee2fb68.avif?t=1759820672 width=800 height=400 /></span></p>",
